{title: We Love Because He First Loved Us}
{subtitle: 1 John 4:19}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 75}
{time: 6/8}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] | [Ebmaj7] |
| [Ebmaj7] | [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]We have come to know this deep [Ebmaj7]truth
[Bb]Believing the love that He [Ebmaj7]shows us
God [Gm]is love, simple and [F]true
Re[Ebmaj7]main in it, let His [F7sus4]peace flow [Bb]through
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
In this [Gm]way, love is brought to completion
[Bb/D]Giving us confidence on judgment day
[Eb]As He is, so [Gm]are we in this world
[Cm7]Walking together in [Fsus4]the light
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]We love because He [Bb]first loved us
We love because He [Gm7]first loved us
No fear re[Eb]mains where His grace is found
Perfect [F]love drives the fear a[Bb]way
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
There is no fear in this holy [Eb]love
It drives out the dread of punishment
[Bb]The one who fears has not been made complete
[Eb]But we stand secure in His presence
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
We love because He [Bb]first loved us
We love because He [Gm7]first loved us
No fear re[Eb]mains where His grace is found
Perfect [F]love drives the fear a[Gm7]way
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
If you say you love the unseen [Bb/D]God
You cannot hate the brother you have seen
[Eb]This is the command we hold [Gm7]dear
Love the [Fsus4]brother, love the [F]Lord
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
We love because He [Bb]first loved us
We love because He [Gm7]first loved us
No fear re[Eb]mains where His grace is found
Perfect [Fsus4]love drives the fear a[Bb]way
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
We love because He [Gm7]first loved us [Eb]
He first loved [Fsus4][Bb]us
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
